	(text "3 FANS ON ONE OUTPUT (sim/fan_count.py)\n302 mA total, 4.8 mV at the drain, 1.5 mW in Q1, 295 mA peaks through the 1N5819 at\nturn-off (a 1 A part), 141 mA average from the 12 V module.  Four fans also fit; four\n150 mA fans would not - they need 452 mA and the L1 - B7 module only gives 450 mA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
